{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53892","headline":"上李珏相公诗（题拟） · 淮南幕吏","name":"上李珏相公诗（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"同姓复同名，金书应梦灵。\n彼行功已满，此德政惟馨。\n中国爲元老，遥天是昴星。\n将知贤相意，不去爲时宁。\n（同前）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"淮南幕吏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53892.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53892","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}